      "user_id": 0,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767400703199999
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you for holding. You've reached VeloFit, my name is Diana. How can I help you today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 401,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767400706266665
    },
    {
      "text": "I need to return this VeloBand.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 54621,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767400712466665
    },
    {
      "text": "I can certainly look into that for you. To understand the situation better, could you tell me what specifically is the issue? Is it a technical fault or a preference?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 401,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767400714733331
    },
    {
      "text": "It's broken. The pulse tracking is not working at all, and it won't sync with the app. It's basically defective.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 54621,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767400725999997
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm very sorry to hear that. A device that won't sync is definitely not the experience we want for our customers. Let me just pull up your account. Can you confirm the full name on the order?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 401,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767400733666663
    },
    {
      "text": "Alex Chen.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 54621,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767400746599996
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you, Alex. I see your order here for the VeloBand GPS Tracker. It looks like it was delivered 18 days ago, on December 15th. Is that correct?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 401,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767400747466662
    },
    {
      "text": "Whatever the system says, sure.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 54621,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767400757466662
    },
    {
