      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 401,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767400759733328
    },
    {
      "text": "Oh. Fine.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 54621,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767400770399994
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes, so I can go ahead and authorize a full refund for you immediately. I'm sending a pre-paid return label to the email we have on file. Just package the band in its original box and drop it off at any post office.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 401,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767400771199994
    },
    {
      "text": "So I just send the broken thing back? That's it?",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 54621,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767400785733327
